# Each app owns its environment. This root file is not loaded.
# Copy apps/web/.env.example to apps/web/.env.local.
# Copy apps/api/.env.example to apps/api/.env.local.
# On the target worker machine, copy apps/worker/.env.example to .env.local
# within apps/worker and set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY there.
# Never give the browser or the Pi worker the API's Supabase secret key.
